      "name": "kingdee_query_report",
      "description": "Query a general-ledger or financial report through the Kingdee GetSysReportData endpoint (for example GL_RPT_AccountBalance or GL_AgingSchedule). The inner data object carries FieldKeys, Model filters, StartRow and Limit exactly as the upstream tool expects.",
